	==============
	 PunBB Readme
	==============

Thank you for downloading PunBB.

The documentation lives in README.md, next to this file: requirements, install
and upgrade steps, extension installation, performance notes and the links.

ChangeLog lists what changed in each release, including the breaking changes an
existing forum has to account for. COPYING carries the GNU General Public
License this package is released under.

